ngRate horizon) ⋯ sensitivity\n                (noiseStddev horizon) epsilon)\n            Filter.atTop\n            (nhds (ENNReal.ofReal (1 - Real.exp (-↑schedule.participationBudget * Mf.DP.stdNormalCDFReal offset))))', {'path': 'Mf/DP/FixedParticipationGaussianAccounting.lean', 'digest': 'sha256:c2da34b048b1c5b37180a9e4da3cc6b62d89182628fa9b45e5eb773cd10b133d', 'projectRevision': 'capture-state:sha256:68213e5db068e5e56be5e88155ff4f3cdc808e4c03baddfa92973590b9466720'}), ('offset-limit', 'Mf.DP.tendsto_fixedParticipationCalibratedStddev_offset', '∀ (schedule : Mf.DP.FixedParticipationSchedule) (sensitivity epsilon delta : ℝ),\n  0 < sensitivity →\n    0 ≤ epsilon →\n      0 < delta →\n        delta < 1 - Real.exp (-↑schedule.participationBudget) →\n          Filter.Tendsto\n            (fun horizon =>\n              sensitivity / ↑(Mf.DP.fixedParticipationCalibratedStddev schedule sensitivity epsilon delta horizon) -\n                Mf.DP.gaussianCriticalScale horizon)\n            Filter.atTop (nhds (Mf.DP.fixedParticipationTargetOffset (↑schedule.participationBudget) delta))', {'path': 'Mf/DP/FixedParticipationGaussianCalibrationAsymptotics.lean', 'digest': 'sha256:0f23d72d33f81e123aad9e260cbeb294724451923aabd5cb467b9ea628df76c8', 'projectRevision': 'capture-state:sha256:978db13bbe7645f42b770a5554d4ecf161f831668f9318ffc48971a5d3263f07'}), ('capped-ratio', 'Mf.DP.tendsto_cappedFixedParticipationCalibratedStddev_smallRate_ratio_one', '∀ (participationBudget : NNReal) (hBudget : 0 < participationBudget) (sensitivity epsilon delta : ℝ),\n  0 < sensitivity →\n    0 ≤ epsilon →\n      0 < delta →\n        delta < 1 - Real.exp (-↑participationBudget) →\n          Filter.Tendsto\n            (fun horizon =>\n              ↑(Mf.DP.fixedParticipationCalibratedStddev\n                      (Mf.DP.cappedFixedParticipationSchedule participationBudget hBudget) sensitivity epsilon delta\n                      horizon) *\n                  √(2 * Real.log (1 / ↑(Mf.DP.cappedPar